---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="What About Meals and Snacks? | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Learn about Marietta Childcare's meal planning, nutrition standards, allergy accommodations, and healthy snack options.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/group_snack_time_healthy_eating_background.jpg" 
        alt="Meals and snacks" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">What About Meals and Snacks?</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Meal planning, nutrition standards, allergy accommodations, and healthy snack options.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">What About Meals and Snacks at Marietta Childcare?</h1>
        
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">Marietta Childcare provides nutritious meals and snacks as part of comprehensive childcare services. Marietta Childcare's nutrition program supports children's healthy growth and development.</p>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Meal Planning and Nutrition Standards</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare follows established nutrition standards for meal planning. Marietta Childcare's meals meet USDA guidelines and Georgia childcare licensing requirements. The meal planning at Marietta Childcare ensures children receive balanced nutrition including proteins, whole grains, fruits, and vegetables.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's nutrition program supports healthy eating habits and food preferences. Marietta Childcare introduces children to diverse foods and flavors. The meals at Marietta Childcare are age-appropriate and developmentally suitable for each age group.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Daily Meal and Snack Schedule</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides multiple meals and snacks throughout the day. Breakfast at Marietta Childcare is available for early arrivals. Marietta Childcare serves lunch and afternoon snacks as part of the daily schedule.</p>
          <p>Snack times at Marietta Childcare include nutritious options like fruits, vegetables, cheese, and whole grain crackers. Marietta Childcare's snack program supports sustained energy and concentration throughout the day. The meal schedule at Marietta Childcare accommodates children's developmental feeding abilities.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Allergy Accommodations</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare takes food allergies seriously and implements strict protocols. Marietta Childcare maintains detailed allergy information for each child. The staff at Marietta Childcare is trained in allergy awareness and emergency response procedures.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides alternative meals for children with food allergies. Marietta Childcare's kitchen staff prepares allergy-safe meals to prevent cross-contamination. Families must disclose all allergies during enrollment at Marietta Childcare. Marietta Childcare communicates regularly with families about allergy management and meal accommodations.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Dietary Restrictions and Preferences</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare accommodates various dietary restrictions and preferences. Marietta Childcare provides vegetarian, vegan, and other specialized diet options. The kitchen at Marietta Childcare can accommodate religious dietary requirements and cultural food preferences.</p>
          <p>Families should inform Marietta Childcare about dietary restrictions during enrollment. Marietta Childcare's staff works with families to ensure children receive appropriate nutrition. Marietta Childcare maintains records of dietary accommodations for each child.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Infant Feeding Practices</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare follows responsive feeding practices for infants. Marietta Childcare supports breastfeeding by providing a clean, private space for nursing mothers. Marietta Childcare stores and handles breast milk according to health and safety guidelines.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare staff at the infant program follows parents' feeding instructions and schedules. Marietta Childcare introduces age-appropriate solid foods according to developmental readiness and family preferences. The infant feeding program at Marietta Childcare supports healthy eating habits from the earliest stages.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Toddler and Preschool Nutrition</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's toddler programs encourage self-feeding and independence. Marietta Childcare serves family-style meals where children serve themselves with staff assistance. The meals at Marietta Childcare support toddlers' developing motor skills and autonomy.</p>
          <p>Preschool programs at Marietta Childcare continue to build healthy eating habits. Marietta Childcare involves children in meal preparation and food discussions. Marietta Childcare's nutrition education teaches preschoolers about healthy foods and balanced meals.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Nutrition Education</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare incorporates nutrition education into the curriculum. Marietta Childcare teaches children about food groups and healthy choices. The curriculum at Marietta Childcare includes gardening activities and food preparation experiences.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's nutrition education supports children's understanding of healthy eating. Marietta Childcare involves families in nutrition discussions and provides resources about healthy eating at home. Marietta Childcare's approach promotes lifelong healthy eating habits.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Food Safety and Sanitation</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare maintains strict food safety and sanitation standards. Marietta Childcare's kitchen follows health department guidelines for food storage, preparation, and serving. The staff at Marietta Childcare receives food safety training.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare prevents foodborne illness through proper handling and storage. Marietta Childcare's sanitation practices protect children's health. Marietta Childcare maintains records of food safety compliance.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Learn About Our Nutrition Program</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare welcomes families to discuss nutrition, allergies, and dietary accommodations. Contact Marietta Childcare to learn more about the meal program and how Marietta Childcare supports your child's nutritional needs.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Contact Us</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Pages</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/faq/curriculum" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">What's Your Curriculum?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/programs" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Our Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/parent-communication" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">How Do You Communicate with Parents?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">About Marietta Childcare</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Contact Marietta Childcare</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
